 {parms}←{note}WriteToLogFile parms;fns;qdmx
⍝ Calls the log function, if there is one, with what is to be logged about the crash.\\
⍝ `note` is the storm guard's note; it is logged as well unless it is empty, the default.\\
⍝ Problems `HandleError` ran into so far are logged too. A log function that fails or cannot be found is
⍝ recorded as such a problem; see `AddProblem`.\\
⍝ Returns `parms`.
 note←{0=⎕NC ⍵:'' ⋄ ⍎⍵}'note'
 :If 0≠≢parms.logFunction
     :Trap (parms.trapInternalErrors)/0
         :If '.'∊parms.logFunction
             fns←⍎parms.logFunction
         :Else
             :If ⍬≢parms.logFunctionParent
                 fns←parms.logFunctionParent⍎parms.logFunction
             :Else
                 'Cannot find the log function'{⍺ ⎕SIGNAL ⍵}6 ⍝ A dfn, so that our own :Trap catches it
             :EndIf
         :EndIf
         fns'*** Error'
         fns'Error number=',⍕parms.LastErrorNumber
         fns parms.LastError
         :If 0≠≢parms.addToMsg
             fns parms.addToMsg
         :EndIf
         :If 0≠≢note
             fns note
         :EndIf
         :If 0≠parms.⎕NC'problems'
         :AndIf 0≠≢parms.problems
             fns parms.problems
         :EndIf
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         parms←('logFunction failed: ',⍕2↑qdmx.DM)AddProblem parms
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf
